{"code":200,"message":"success","data":[{"id":201229,"name":"绝夜逢生2 2K","descs":"　　在地下深处找到避难所后，乘客们又面对着一堆新危机，并与收留他们的军队的关系变得越来越紧张。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKyJDrIBf24C2WwjpjnuWu3M8fu.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qKyJDrIBf24C2WwjpjnuWu3M8fu.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/p3aaR9NYGw9itEtNMR6ey1Dkwrz.jpg","type2":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","rating":7.1,"release":"2021-09-08"},{"id":201225,"name":"绝夜逢生1 2K","descs":"　　一架在布鲁塞尔的航班起飞后，此时太阳活动突变令到被照射到的生物通通死亡，因此有幸逃过一劫的飞机试图向西面飞去以躲在黑暗中。航班上包括富豪﹑穷人﹑年轻人﹑老人﹑平民﹑军人等，他们只有一个目标：在这太阳浩劫下幸存……问题有些人为此可是会不择手段。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKyJDrIBf24C2WwjpjnuWu3M8fu.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qKyJDrIBf24C2WwjpjnuWu3M8fu.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bW1PKJxRQqeUbhDzLnBJQ8VDQs0.jpg","type2":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","rating":7.1,"release":"2020-05-01"},{"id":201228,"name":"海上谋杀案3 2K","descs":"　　芭芭拉·德布莱干萨号离开阿根廷驶向墨西哥，船上一名科学家携带有一种致命病毒，伊娃加入了找出此人的行动。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4x2N5p2jm5p0PSzTCmHPWJdw03L.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4x2N5p2jm5p0PSzTCmHPWJdw03L.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8fKWzuR3o8NZQ3xuaGHI7QUKeho.jpg","type2":"犯罪/剧情","rating":7.0,"release":"2022-08-07"},{"id":201227,"name":"海上谋杀案2 2K","descs":"　　前往巴西的邮轮继续航行，中途不断有乘客登上这艘邮轮，而船上所发生的事情令人无法解释，因此这艘船闹鬼的谣言开始传播开来。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggnl4LfAWzT5lSsAFUre1WWZMM2.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ggnl4LfAWzT5lSsAFUre1WWZMM2.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fLQCCYmZ9JurgWLvMwnsHPNtCGG.jpg","type2":"犯罪/剧情","rating":7.0,"release":"2019-11-22"},{"id":201226,"name":"海上谋杀案1 2K","descs":"　　20 世纪 40 年代，一艘豪华邮轮从西班牙前往巴西，途中遇上连串神秘死亡事件，而一对姐妹也因此发现了令人不安的家族秘密。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaktroJakyvAuiY2umSMLyjROis.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/gaktroJakyvAuiY2umSMLyjROis.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2kO3rRnEEqbf9GYBsAs7sgjWsO.jpg","type2":"犯罪/剧情","rating":7.0,"release":"2019-05-24"},{"id":201224,"name":"雪国列车4 2K","descs":"　　新环境的探索与挑战：在第三季的结尾，人类幸存者被分为两组，一组留在雪国列车上，另一组则在外界建立了名为“新伊甸园”的社区。 第四季聚焦于这个新社区，尤其是莱顿和新伊甸集团的成员如何努力在新环境中建立家园。 新伊甸园位于气候相对温和的区域，看似天堂，实则隐藏着未知的威胁和挑战。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHvQ76m4dId6QJjgZA8z0UlkUUl.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rHvQ76m4dId6QJjgZA8z0UlkUUl.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/z7hWp2EVlfz58ORWQ9f26nHWKaS.jpg","type2":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy/剧情","rating":7.4,"release":"2024-07-21"},{"id":201223,"name":"雪国列车3 2K","descs":"　　六个月后，雷顿继续在全球寻找宜居之地。同时，愤怒的威尔福德复仇心切，仍然对他紧追不舍。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuF0FPo8ZrOqn2AfrV5srAMVqdw.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/AuF0FPo8ZrOqn2AfrV5srAMVqdw.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o6fHn0sD4O8bePYpwbVHx4AwBi.jpg","type2":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy/剧情","rating":7.4,"release":"2022-01-24"},{"id":201222,"name":"雪国列车2 2K","descs":"　　大爱丽丝挂在了雪国列车后面，威尔福德先生决定夺回列车。梅尔和雷顿奋力一搏，计划阻止他。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LxBBMHXVtrKoJheUAhLsZK0TFF.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/8LxBBMHXVtrKoJheUAhLsZK0TFF.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4keGn9vspcwYhIw03g6WVALmtUG.jpg","type2":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy/剧情","rating":7.4,"release":"2021-01-25"},{"id":201221,"name":"雪国列车1 2K","descs":"　　世界已被冰封，人类最后一批幸存者生活在一辆环球奔驰的巨型列车上。他们要在微妙的平衡关系之下艰难共存。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFJxwXtW3Y7FSDrc2FnVFpQCcY1.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zFJxwXtW3Y7FSDrc2FnVFpQCcY1.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/z3YEVEVK2eKG7pbDkH13NCFkxUp.jpg","type2":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy/剧情","rating":7.4,"release":"2020-05-17"},{"id":201220,"name":"后翼弃兵 2K","descs":"　　20 世纪 50 年代，一所孤儿院中的小女孩展露惊人的国际象棋天赋，从此踏上了意想不到的成名之路，但她同时也在努力应对自己的成瘾问题。","slimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34OGjFEbHj0E3lE2w0iTUVq0CBz.jpg","limg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/34OGjFEbHj0E3lE2w0iTUVq0CBz.jpg","vimg":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/n6KHGilNYdb90eDPAE1IAzr2Vt1.jpg","type2":"剧情","rating":8.4,"release":"2020-10-23"}],"timestamp":1787023811505,